self-check: the replay reproduces 30/30 shipped resumes word-for-word, all 444 provenance bullets are found in their own document, and rubric(credits) == labels.csv for 30/30
requirement map: 6 JD bullets <-> python_pandas, ml_sklearn, sql, visualization, nlp_llm, communication, keyword-asserted
ground truth: 217 evidence bullets over 86 proven skill-instances, 227 filler bullets, mean 7.2 evidence bullets per CV; the 3 hand-written CVs have no provenance and are excluded

